  "description": "The prebuilt standalone Tailwind CSS 4.3.5 program (tailwindcss) for Linux Arm64 build machines, packaged for building CodeBrix.WebPlatform applications. Referencing the package copies the program, with its licence and third-party notices files, into the referencing project's output folder as tailwind/linux-arm64/ - nothing has to be installed, and no Node.js is involved. Choose the package of the machine the frontend is BUILT on. The source of the program, including the LGPL-licensed source it contains, comes with the CodeBrix.WebPlatform.Styling.Tailwind4.Sources package, which this package depends on.",
